# <type>(<scope>): <short imperative summary>
#
# Types:
#   feat      new behavior or capability
#   fix       bug fix or invariant correction
#   test      test-only changes
#   docs      documentation-only changes
#   refactor  internal restructure without behavior change
#   perf      measured performance improvement
#   chore     tooling, config, repo maintenance
#
# Suggested scopes:
#   schema, preprocessing, datasets, dictionaries, retrieval, linking, ner,
#   context, relations, kg, evaluation, pipeline, docs, tests, tooling
#
# Body:
# - What changed:
# - Why:
# - Risk / compatibility:
#
# Validation:
# - [ ] targeted pytest:
# - [ ] full pytest:
# - [ ] ruff:
# - [ ] mypy:
# - [ ] prediction validator, if output/schema/linking/KG changed:
#
# Medical NLP invariants:
# - [ ] offsets preserved or not touched
# - [ ] no dictionary-absent final codes
# - [ ] no drug -> ICD-10 mapping
# - [ ] no disease -> RxNorm mapping
# - [ ] negated/family-history context remains non-present
#
# Breaking changes:
# - None
